      "title": "Any business user can read every table in the production database",
      "scenario": "A business user (or anyone who steals their session) types SELECT * against customer, employee or payment tables in the free SQL editor. Because the editor runs arbitrary SQL against a replica of production, there is no per-table or per-row restriction, so one low-privileged user can read the personal data of every customer and export it from the dashboard.",
      "component": "SQL editor / production read replica",
      "likelihood": 5,
      "impact": 5,
